# A view style chosen by script is not stored per folder: no vstl record shows
# up after Finder has written everything (see evidence E7).
# Params: name, view (icon|list|column|flow).
reset
mkcase {name}
finder-set {name} current-view {view}
expect {name} current-view "{view} view"
flush
expect-no-dump {name} 'vstl'
